;; Single-goal variant of grid8x8-4.pddl: the goal is (at truck1 p8-8) only.
;; 8 x 8 grid of places, roads between adjacent cells;
;; no airports;
;; 1 truck at the origin p1-1, 0 airplanes over the airports.
;; No packages: the goal sends each truck to a destination.
;; Every destination is at least 9 steps from the origin by road (21 places qualify).
;;

